  "confidence": "HIGH on text, localization, identity, placement and completeness — the display heading and both drop-cap paragraphs are large and clear, and the bulk of the prose is legible in bands despite the soft ~138 DPI S8 scan. HIGH-visual but POLICY-FLAGGED on the w/vv regime (italic=gapped vv diverges from the ratified preface connected-w note; routed for Sir). MEDIUM on the finest sh-cluster long-ſ-vs-round-s calls and a few French-space colons at this resolution (flagged in uncertain).",
